tooltip.icy_punishing.weapon.honglian.da:
Blade length 1.0 m, forged from reinforced tungsten high-speed steel with excellent heat resistance;
no known surface high temperature can affect it in the slightest.
Beyond its edge, Honglian can also qualitatively change a construct's attack patterns.

tooltip.icy_punishing.weapon.hongying.da:
Blade length 1.0 m, forged by violently blending many materials together;
surprisingly, the blade's strength did not decrease because of it.
For some reason, the more it is used to slash, the redder the blade becomes.
